<title>USA: Northeast Utilities named in lawsuit.</title>
<headline>Northeast Utilities named in lawsuit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northeast Utilities was named in a lawsuit that alleges its directors of misrepresenting and concealing material facts about the company's operations, a law firm said.</p>
<p>A Northeast Utilities spokeswoman said the company had not yet been served with the suit and had no comment.</p>
<p>The lawsuit was filed in U.S. District Court of Connecticut on behalf of purchasers of the company's stock between March 18, 1994 and April 5, 1996, Abbey, Gardy &amp; Squitieri LLP, the law firm, said in a statement.</p>
</text>
